msgstr "If no exact registration match is found and ``resolve_inherited_types`` is valid, it traverses Maya's node type inheritance chain from the direct parent to the base type, and returns the first registered ancestor class found. For example, even if a plug-in adds a custom node type inheriting from ``locator``, the registered class for ``locator`` will be selected."

