msgstr "``cmds.nodeType(node_type, isTypeName=True, inherited=True)`` can query inheritance relationships using only type names without requiring actual node instances, but since querying Maya repeatedly is somewhat slow, the results are cached per type name. Since Maya API 2.0 lacks an equivalent querying mechanism, cmds is used."

msgid "node_type 自身を先頭に、直接の親から基底型へ     向かう順の継承チェーン。Maya が認識しない型名の場合は     node_type 自身のみを含む1要素の tuple。"
msgstr "``node_type`` itself at the head, followed by the inheritance chain in order from direct parent to base type. A one-element tuple containing only the ``node_type`` itself if the type name is not recognized by Maya."

