msgstr "``hlib.addConstraint(sources, target, type=\"parent\", maintainOffset=False)`` returns a single Constraint. Query it with Constraint.getTargets()/getWeightPlugs(), edit weights with setWeight(), and access other attributes through Plug. query/edit are not accepted. Supported types are parent, point, orient, scale, aim, poleVector, geometry, normal, tangent, and pointOnPoly. Type names with a Constraint suffix are also accepted."

