msgstr "After selecting a command name, you can view its syntax, return value, flags, and usage examples. In Python, it is called as ``hlib.<コマンド名>()``."

msgid "ls"
msgstr "ls"

msgid "名前や条件で Maya ノードを検索し、検索結果を hlib ラッパーへ変換します。"
msgstr "Search for Maya nodes by name or condition, and convert the search results to hlib wrappers."

msgid "シーンの検索操作です。戻り値はノードとしてラップするため、型名やコンポーネントなどノード名以外を返すフラグの組み合わせには対応しません。"
msgstr "This is a scene search operation. Since the return values are wrapped as nodes, it does not support combinations of flags that return types other than node names, such as component or typename."

msgid "``list[Node | Plug] | Joints | SkinClusters``"
msgstr "``list[Node | Plug] | Joints | SkinClusters``"

msgid "type=\"joint\" は Joints、type=\"skinCluster\" は SkinClusters。それ以外は Node のリスト。検索結果がない場合は空のリストまたは空の専用コレクション。"
msgstr "type=\"joint\" is Joints, type=\"skinCluster\" is SkinClusters. Others are lists of Nodes. If there are no search results, then an empty list or a dedicated empty collection."

msgid ":doc:`createNode <../createNode/index>` / :doc:`constraint <../addConstraint/index>`"
msgstr ":doc:`createNode <../createNode/index>` / :doc:`constraint <../addConstraint/index>`"

