msgstr "``str | Node | Plug | Component | Components | MObject | MDagPath | MPlug | Iterable``"

msgid "名前やワイルドカードなど、maya.cmds.ls の位置引数。文字列以外は一意な名前に変換して渡します（:doc:`/cmds_interop`）。空の列と ``None`` は空の結果になります。"
msgstr "Positional arguments of maya.cmds.ls such as names or wildcards. Non-string values are converted to unique names (:doc:`/cmds_interop`). Empty lists and ``None`` result in empty outputs."

