msgstr ":py:obj:`__radd__ <hlib.maths.eulerRotation.EulerRotation.__radd__>`\\ \\(other\\)"

msgid "左辺の MEulerRotation 系との和を返す。"
msgstr "Returns the sum with the left-hand side MEulerRotation type."

