msgid "om2.MMatrix を継承した、Maya の行ベクトル規約の可変な4行4列変換行列。"
msgstr "A variable 4x4 transformation matrix that inherits from om2.MMatrix and follows Maya's row vector convention."

msgid "行優先順で16要素を持ち、平行移動は添字12、13、14に置く。``om2.MMatrix`` の 派生クラスなので、``MTransformationMatrix(m)`` や ``MFnMatrixData().create(m)`` など OpenMaya API 2.0 の関数へそのまま渡せる。成分からの合成と分解は アフィン変換を想定し、分解は ``om2.MTransformationMatrix`` と同じ規約になる (行列式が負の場合は Z スケールを負にして 180 度の補償回転を入れる。 ``cmds.xform`` や decomposeMatrix ノードと同じ)。"
msgstr "A 16-element row-major array with translation components at indices 12, 13, and 14. Since it is derived from ``om2.MMatrix``, it can be passed directly to OpenMaya API 2.0 functions such as ``MTransformationMatrix(m)`` or ``MFnMatrixData().create(m)``. Composition and decomposition assume an affine transformation, and the decomposition follows the same convention as ``om2.MTransformationMatrix`` (if the determinant is negative, negate the Z scale and apply a 180-degree compensation rotation, similar to ``cmds.xform`` or the decomposeMatrix node)."

msgid "演算子は om2 の意味論に従う。"
msgstr "Operators follow the semantics of om2."

msgid "``a * b`` / ``a @ b``: 行列積(``a`` を先に適用する)。結果は ``type(a)``。 ``om2.MMatrix * Matrix`` も Matrix を返す。"
msgstr "``a * b`` / ``a @ b``: Matrix multiplication (apply ``a`` first). The result is ``type(a)``. ``om2.MMatrix * Matrix`` also returns a Matrix."

msgid "``m * 数値``、``a + b``、``a - b``: om2 の成分ごとの演算を包んで返す。"
msgstr "``m * 数値``, ``a + b``, ``a - b``: Wrap and return component-wise operations on om2."

msgid "``v * m`` (v は Vector): 行ベクトル規約の方向変換(平行移動を含まない)。 ``om2.MVector * m`` / ``om2.MPoint * m`` は om2 側が先に処理するため om2 の型を返す。"
msgstr "``v * m`` (v is Vector): Row vector convention direction transformation (excluding translation). ``om2.MVector * m`` / ``om2.MPoint * m`` returns the om2 type because the om2 side processes first."

msgid "``m * v`` (v は om2.MVector を含む MVector 系): om2 と同じ列ベクトルとしての積 (``v * mᵀ``)の :class:`~hlib.maths.vector.Vector`。"
msgstr "``m * v`` (where v is an MVector from om2.MVector): The same column vector as in om2, for the product ``v * mᵀ`` of :class:`~hlib.maths.vector.Vector`."

msgid "``m * p`` (p は om2.MPoint): om2 の列ベクトルとしての積(同次座標の4成分)の x、y、z を持つ Vector。結果の w は捨てる(``Vector(om2.MPoint)`` と同じく w で割らない)。"
msgstr "``m * p`` (where p is an om2.MPoint): A vector holding the x, y, and z components of the product (four components of homogeneous coordinates) as a column vector in om2. The resulting w component is discarded (not divided by w, just like in ``Vector(om2.MPoint)``)."

msgid "``m @ v`` は TypeError。位置の変換には :meth:`transformPoint` (または ``om2.MPoint(p) * m``)を使う。"
msgstr "``m @ v`` is a TypeError. Use :meth:`transformPoint` (or ``om2.MPoint(p) * m``) for position conversion."

msgid "``*=`` / ``@=`` / ``+=`` / ``-=`` は自身を書き換える。値は可変で、添字 ``m[i]`` (-16〜15)/ ``m[行, 列]`` (それぞれ -4〜3)へ代入できる。範囲外は IndexError。ハッシュは不可。``==`` は完全一致で、MMatrix 系なら om2.MMatrix とも 等しくなり得る。MMatrix 系以外との比較は :class:`~hlib.maths.vector.Vector` と 同じく例外にしない。成分を取得するプロパティ(``translate`` など)は複製を返すため、 戻り値を書き換えても行列は変わらない。"
msgstr "``*=`` / ``@=`` / ``+=`` / ``-=`` modify themselves. Values are mutable and can be assigned to indices ``m[i]`` (-16 to 15) / ``m[行, 列]`` (respectively -4 to 3). Out-of-range access raises IndexError. Hashing is not supported. ``==`` performs exact matching, and when comparing with MMatrix types, it can also be equal to om2.MMatrix. Comparisons with non-MMatrix types do not raise exceptions, just like :class:`~hlib.maths.vector.Vector`. Properties that retrieve components (such as ``translate`` etc.) return copies, so modifying the returned value does not change the matrix."

