msgstr "When setting, it takes 3 components and resynthesizes while preserving rotation, scale, and translation. For both getting and setting, a ValueError is raised if it cannot be decomposed."

msgid "分解したシアー成分。"
msgstr "Decomposed shear components."

msgid "取得値は複製。設定時は3成分を受け取り、行列を分解せずに添字12〜14へ直接 書き込むため、ゼロスケールなど分解できない行列にも使える。"
msgstr "The retrieved value is a copy. When setting, it accepts three components and writes directly to indices 12-14 without decomposing the matrix, making it usable even with matrices that cannot be decomposed, such as zero scale."

