msgstr ":py:obj:`__mul__ <hlib.maths.transformation.Transformation.__mul__>`\\ \\(other\\)"

msgid "行列を後乗算し、translateと回転ピボットの位置を追従させたコピーを返す。"
msgstr "Returns a copy that follows the translation and rotation pivot positions by post-multiplying the matrix."

msgid ":py:obj:`__repr__ <hlib.maths.transformation.Transformation.__repr__>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`__repr__ <hlib.maths.transformation.Transformation.__repr__>`\\ \\(\\)"

msgid "成分の内容を確認できる文字列表現を返す。"
msgstr "Returns a string representation that allows you to check the contents of the component."

