msgstr ":py:obj:`_transfer_rotation <hlib.nodes.joint.Joints._transfer_rotation>`\\ \\(\\[to\\_orient\\]\\)"

msgid "全対象の準備成功後に回転移送を適用する。"
msgstr "Apply the rotation transfer after all targets are prepared."

msgid ":py:obj:`delete <hlib.nodes.joint.Joints.delete>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`delete <hlib.nodes.joint.Joints.delete>`\\ \\(\\)"

msgid "ウェイト移送後にコレクション内の joint を削除する。"
msgstr "Delete joints in the collection after transferring weights."

msgid ":py:obj:`freezeRotation <hlib.nodes.joint.Joints.freezeRotation>`\\ \\(\\*\\[\\, fast\\]\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`freezeRotation <hlib.nodes.joint.Joints.freezeRotation>`\\ \\(\\*\\[\\, fast\\]\\)"

msgid "全jointのrotateをjointOrientへ移し、姿勢を保ってrotateを0にする。"
msgstr "Copy the rotate values of all joints to jointOrient, and then set rotate to 0 while maintaining the pose."

msgid ":py:obj:`getSkinClusters <hlib.nodes.joint.Joints.getSkinClusters>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`getSkinClusters <hlib.nodes.joint.Joints.getSkinClusters>`\\ \\(\\)"

msgid "全 joint に関連する skinCluster を取得する。"
msgstr "Get all skinClusters related to all joints."

msgid ":py:obj:`jointOrientToRotate <hlib.nodes.joint.Joints.jointOrientToRotate>`\\ \\(\\*\\[\\, fast\\]\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`jointOrientToRotate <hlib.nodes.joint.Joints.jointOrientToRotate>`\\ \\(\\*\\[\\, fast\\]\\)"

msgid "全jointの姿勢を保ち、jointOrientをrotateへ合成して0にする。"
msgstr "Preserve the pose of all joints, accumulate jointOrient to rotate, and set it to 0."

msgid ":py:obj:`sortedByDepth <hlib.nodes.joint.Joints.sortedByDepth>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`sortedByDepth <hlib.nodes.joint.Joints.sortedByDepth>`\\ \\(\\)"

msgid "深い joint から順に並べた新しいコレクションを返す。"
msgstr "Returns a new collection sorted in depth-first order from the joints."

msgid "TrueならrotateをjointOrientへ移す。"
msgstr "If true, move rotate to jointOrient."

msgid "自身。途中の失敗で完了済み更新は自動で戻さない。"
msgstr "Self. Automatically rolls back completed updates on failure only if the update was not already started."

msgid "同じjointの複数インスタンスパスはノード単位で一度だけ処理する。 未スキニングjointも削除する。子Transform（jointを含む）は親へ移し、 親がない場合はワールドへ移す。同じskinClusterの祖先influenceがあれば加算し、 移送先がない場合のウェイト処理はMaya標準のcmds.deleteに任せる。 途中の失敗は例外で停止し、完了済み変更は自動ロールバックしない。全体はUndoに対応。"
msgstr "Multiple instance paths of the same joint are processed only once per node. Unskinned joints are also removed. Children transforms (including joints) are moved to their parents; if there is no parent, they are moved to the world. If there are ancestors with the same skinCluster influence, their weights are added together. Weight processing for destinations that do not exist is left to Maya's standard ``cmds.delete``. Failures during processing stop with an exception, and changes already applied are not automatically rolled back. The entire process is undoable."

msgid "ウェイト移送・子の再親付け・削除ができない場合。"
msgstr "Cannot transfer weights, re-parent children, or delete."

msgid "スキニング済みでも実行でき、ウェイト・bindPreMatrix・バインドポーズを 変更しない。全対象を事前検証し、全体を一回のUndoで戻せる。 移動・スケールのフリーズやアニメーションのベイクは行わない。 途中の編集失敗は例外で停止し、完了済み変更はUndoで戻せる。"
msgstr "Can be executed even on skinned objects without modifying weight, bindPreMatrix, or bind pose. Validates all targets beforehand and can be undone in a single step. Does not freeze translation/scale or bake animation. Stops with an exception on intermediate edit failures, but completed changes can be undone."

msgid "無効joint、ロック・入力接続・書込み不可、編集失敗。"
msgstr "Invalid joint, locked input connections, write-protected, edit failed."

msgid "重複を除いた skinCluster コレクション。"
msgstr "A deduplicated skinCluster collection."

msgid "全対象の値と書込み可否を変更前に検証する。回転順序・角度単位に対応し、 jointOrientが0の対象は変更しない。全体を一回のUndoで戻せる。 途中でMayaの編集が失敗した場合は例外で停止し、完了済み変更はUndoで戻せる。"
msgstr "Verify the values and writeability of all targets before making changes. Supports rotation order and angle units; targets with jointOrient at 0 will not be modified. Entire operation can be undone in a single step. If Maya editing fails at any point, an exception will stop execution, but any completed changes can still be undone."

msgid "子 joint を先に処理できる深さ順コレクション。"
msgstr "Depth-first collection that processes child joints first."

