msgstr "Add to the ancestor influence and then unregister. Do not delete the joint node."

msgid ":py:obj:`removeUnusedInfluences <hlib.nodes.skinCluster.SkinCluster.removeUnusedInfluences>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`removeUnusedInfluences <hlib.nodes.skinCluster.SkinCluster.removeUnusedInfluences>`\\ \\(\\)"

msgid "未使用influenceの登録を外す。jointノード自体は削除しない。"
msgstr "Unregister unused influences. Do not delete the joint nodes themselves."

