msgid "reference と同じ回転順序の、reference に最も近い解 (``MEulerRotation.closestSolution``。360 度の周期と、中間軸を反転した別解を考慮する)。"
msgstr "The rotation order that is closest to the reference (the ``MEulerRotation.closestSolution`` solution, considering a 360-degree period and alternative solutions with inverted intermediate axes)."

msgid "2軸のスケールの符号を同時に反転し、残りの軸まわりの 180 度回転で補償しても 行列は変わらない(D を2軸が -1 の対角行列として S·Sh·R = (S·D)·(D·Sh·D)·(D·R))。 行列式の符号は変えられないため、references を先頭から順に調べ、反転が必要な軸が 0 個または 2 個(行列式の符号と合う)の最初の基準に揃える。どの基準とも合わない (奇数個の軸が違う)場合は入力(om2 の規約)のまま返す。"
msgstr "The matrix remains unchanged even if the signs of the 2-axis scales are inverted simultaneously and the remaining axis is compensated by a 180-degree rotation (where D is a diagonal matrix with -1 on the 2 axes, S·Sh·R = (S·D)·(D·Sh·D)·(D·R)). Since the sign of the determinant cannot be changed, we examine the references in order from the beginning and align the first standard that has either 0 or 2 inverted axes (matching the determinant's sign). If none of the standards match (i.e., an odd number of axes differ), we return as is according to the input convention (om2)."

