msgstr "``Object(value)`` returns a concrete wrapper corresponding to the target. Equivalence comparison, hashing, and lifetime determination are handled by each reference type. Collections, mathematical values, storage data, and UI references are not included in this base."

msgid ":py:obj:`_classes <hlib.object.Object._classes>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`_classes <hlib.object.Object._classes>`\\ \\(\\)"

msgid "循環 import を避けるため、判定に使う hlib クラスを呼び出し時に取得する。"
msgstr "To avoid circular imports, obtain the hlib class used for checks at call time."

