msgstr "With ``array_plug[index]``, you can obtain the element Plug of a logical index. Due to this ``__getitem__``, maya.cmds fails when attempting to expand an ArrayPlug object as a sequence (``cmds.getAttr(array_plug)`` is not allowed). When passing an entire array attribute to maya.cmds, pass ``str(array_plug)`` or ``array_plug.getFullName()``. Element Plugs (``array_plug[0]``) and hlib commands (``hlib.select``, etc.) accept ArrayPlug objects directly."

