msgid "整数または文字列以外を指定した場合。boolも拒否する。"
msgstr "Any value other than integer or string is rejected. bool is also rejected."

msgid "子インデックス。"
msgstr "Sub-index."

msgid "子の数と同じ長さの値。"
msgstr "Values with the same length as the number of children."

msgid "子の変更を一回のUndoにまとめる。要素数は先に検査する。 float/long/shortの固定長数値型は全子の書込み可否を確認し型付きで一括設定する。 その他の複合型は子ごとの設定を使う。途中の失敗時に完了済みの値は自動で戻さない。"
msgstr "Group child changes into a single undo. Check the number of elements in advance. For fixed-length numeric types such as float/long/short, confirm write permissions for all children and set them in bulk with type information. For other compound types, use individual settings per child. If a failure occurs during the process, do not automatically revert already completed values."

msgid "子プラグと同じ数の値。先頭から順に設定する。"
msgstr "The same number of values as child plugs. Set them in order from the head."

msgid "自身。safe=Trueでは失敗した成分数。"
msgstr "Self. Number of failed components when safe=True."

msgid "要素数が子数と一致しない場合。"
msgstr "The number of elements does not match the number of children."

