msgstr "Normalized held name. No existence check."

msgid "移動先を作成し、force=True で内容を移して元を削除する。自身の保持名はここでは更新しない。"
msgstr "Create a new destination and move the contents to it with force=True, then delete the original. The name held by the object itself is not updated here."

