msgstr ":py:obj:`_track <hlib.utils.progress._track>`\\ \\(iterable\\, line\\)"

msgid "要素を順に返しながら、line の件数更新と描画を行うジェネレーター。"
msgstr "A generator that yields elements one by one, while updating the number of lines and redrawing."

msgid ":py:obj:`progressBar <hlib.utils.progress.progressBar>`\\ \\(iterable\\, \\*\\[\\, label\\, total\\, width\\, ...\\]\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`progressBar <hlib.utils.progress.progressBar>`\\ \\(iterable\\, \\*\\[\\, label\\, total\\, width\\, ...\\]\\)"

msgid "要素をそのまま返しつつ、処理の進み具合を1行で表示するイテレーターを作る。"
msgstr "Create an iterator that returns elements as-is while displaying the progress of the process on a single line."

msgid "浮動小数点の丸め誤差で値が1つ小さくなるのを避けるため、整数演算で 切り捨てる。全体が0件の場合や、処理済み件数が全体に達した・超えた 場合は scale に揃える。"
msgstr "To avoid values being reduced by one due to floating-point rounding errors, truncate using integer arithmetic. When all items are zero or when the number of processed items has reached or exceeded the total, align with the scale."

msgid "処理済みの件数。"
msgstr "Number of processed items."

msgid "全体の件数。"
msgstr "Total count."

msgid "換算後の最大値。"
msgstr "Maximum value after conversion."

msgid "0 以上 scale 以下の整数。"
msgstr "An integer greater than or equal to 0 and less than or equal to scale."

msgid "最初の要素を取り出せた時点で0件の行を描画し、利用側が次の要素を 要求するたび(=直前の要素の処理が終わるたび)に1件進める。途中で ``break`` した場合や例外でジェネレーターが閉じられた場合も、描画に 着手していれば改行で行を閉じる。描画そのもの(出力や ``notify``)が 例外を送出した場合も同様で、書きかけの行を改行で閉じてから例外を 伝える。要素が1つも無ければ何も出力しない。"
msgstr "Once the first element is retrieved, render a blank line and advance by one element each time the consumer requests the next element (i.e., whenever the previous element has been processed). If ``break`` occurs or if the generator is closed due to an exception, close the line with a newline character if rendering has started. Similarly, if an exception is raised during the rendering itself (during output or ``notify``), close the incomplete line with a newline character before propagating the exception. If there are no elements, produce no output."

msgid "例外が伝わっている途中で行を閉じる場合、改行の書き込みに失敗しても その失敗は捨て、先に起きた例外をそのまま伝える(閉じられた出力先へ もう一度書こうとして別の例外に置き換わるのを防ぐ)。最後まで反復 できた場合の改行の失敗は、そのまま呼び出し側へ伝える。"
msgstr "When closing a line in the middle of exception propagation, even if writing a newline fails, that failure is discarded and the previously occurred exception is propagated as is (to prevent the replacement with another exception when attempting to write again to the closed output). If writing a newline fails only after successfully completing the iteration, that failure is propagated as is to the caller."

msgid "反復する対象。"
msgstr "Iterated target."

msgid "描画を担当する進捗行。"
msgstr "Progress bar that handles rendering."

msgid "*object* -- iterable の要素をそのまま返す。"
msgstr "*object* -- returns the elements of an iterable as-is."

msgid "``for`` 文の対象を包むだけで使える。表示は「処理済みの件数」を基準にし、 ループ本体が1回終わって次の要素が要求されるたびに1件進む。最初の要素を 取り出した時点で0件の状態を描画し、最後まで反復したときに改行で行を閉じる。 ``break`` などで途中で抜けた場合は、返り値のジェネレーターが ``close()`` されるか回収された時点で行を閉じる(このときの改行の書き込み失敗は無視する)。要素が1つも無い場合は何も出力せず、``notify`` も 呼ばない。ループ本体・出力先・``notify`` のいずれかで例外が起きた 場合はその例外をそのまま伝え、行を閉じる改行の書き込みが続けて 失敗しても元の例外を置き換えない。"
msgstr "``for`` can be used simply by wrapping the target of the statement. The display is based on the \"number of processed items,\" advancing by one item each time the loop body completes and the next element is requested. When the first element is retrieved, the state is rendered as 0 items, and when iteration completes through all elements, a newline closes the line. If ``break`` causes an early exit, the generator's return value will either be ``close()`` or closed upon collection, at which point the line is closed (ignoring any failure to write the newline). If there are no elements, nothing is output and ``notify`` is not called. If an exception occurs in any of the loop body, output destination, or ``notify``, that exception is propagated as-is, and even if writing the closing newline fails afterward, it does not replace the original exception."

msgid "行の更新は行頭復帰(``\\r``)による上書きで行う。Maya の Script Editor のように行頭復帰を解釈しない出力先では、描画ごとの文字列が上書きされず 順に残る場合がある。"
msgstr "Line updates are performed by overwriting at the beginning of the line (using ``\\r``). In destinations that do not interpret line feed characters (such as Maya's Script Editor), the strings for each drawing may not be overwritten but instead remain sequentially."

msgid "引数の検証と ``len()`` による件数の取得は呼び出し時に行い、要素の 取り出しと描画は返り値を反復したときに行う。"
msgstr "Argument validation and getting the count with ``len()`` are performed at call time, while extracting and drawing elements are done when iterating over the return value."

msgid "進捗を表示しながら反復する対象。"
msgstr "Progress indicator for iterative operations."

msgid "行頭に付ける見出し。文字列のみ受け付ける。末尾の空白は 取り除き、バーとの間に空白を1つ挟む。空文字(または空白だけ)なら 見出しを付けない。"
msgstr "Heading to prepend to lines. Only accepts strings. Trims trailing whitespace and inserts one space between the bar and the heading. If empty (or contains only whitespace), no heading is added."

msgid "全体の件数。None なら ``len(iterable)`` を試み、 ``len()`` を持たない場合は件数不明として、バーと百分率を省いて 処理済み件数だけを表示する。実際の要素数が total を超えた場合、 バーと百分率は満杯のまま件数だけが増える。"
msgstr "Total count. If None, attempt ``len(iterable)``, and if it does not have ``len()``, show only the processed count without the bar and percentage. If the actual number of elements exceeds total, the bar and percentage will remain full while only the count increases."

msgid "バー部分の文字数。1以上の整数。"
msgstr "Number of characters in the bar area. Integer greater than or equal to 1."

msgid "``write`` を備える出力先。``flush`` を持つ 場合は描画のたびに呼ぶ。None なら呼び出し時点の ``sys.stdout`` (``contextlib.redirect_stdout`` の差し替え先も含む)を使う。"
msgstr "Output destination with ``write``. If ``flush`` is present, it will be called every time the drawing is performed. If None, use the current ``sys.stdout`` at the time of the call (including replacements in ``contextlib.redirect_stdout``)."

msgid "行を描画するたびに、その 表示文字列(行頭復帰と改行を含まない)を受け取るコールバック。 戻り値は無視する。要素数と同程度の回数呼ばれるため、外部サービス へ送る場合は必要に応じて呼び出し側で間引く。"
msgstr "A callback that receives the display string (excluding leading carriage returns and newlines) each time a line is drawn. The return value is ignored. It is called as many times as there are elements, so if sending to an external service, consider rate-limiting on the caller's side as needed."

msgid "iterable の要素を同じ順序でそのまま返すイテレーター。"
msgstr "An iterator that returns the elements of an iterable in the same order as they appear."

msgid "label が文字列でない場合、width が整数でない場合、 または total が None でも整数でもない場合。"
msgstr "If the label is not a string, or the width is not an integer, or the total is neither None nor an integer."

msgid "width が1未満の場合、または total が負の場合。"
msgstr "When width is less than 1, or when total is negative."

