msgstr "``environment``"

msgid "Preferences、Workspace、Plugin、PluginPackage、Module。作業環境と導入状態"
msgstr "Preferences, Workspace, Plugin, PluginPackage, Module. Working environment and installation status."

msgid "``events``"
msgstr "``events``"

msgid "ScriptJob、ScriptJobs、Deferred。通知の寿命と遅延実行"
msgstr "ScriptJob, ScriptJobs, Deferred. Lifetime of notifications and deferred execution"

msgid "``maths``"
msgstr "``maths``"

msgid "OpenMaya API 2.0 の型を継承した可変の値型。Vector・Translation・Scale・Shear は ``MVector``、Quaternion は ``MQuaternion``、EulerRotation は ``MEulerRotation``、 Matrix は ``MMatrix`` の派生で、om2 の関数へそのまま渡せ、演算の意味も om2 に従う (ハッシュ不可)。``easing`` だけは標準の ``math`` のみを使う"
msgstr "A mutable value type inheriting from OpenMaya API 2.0 types. Vector, Translation, Scale, and Shear inherit from ``MVector``, Quaternion from ``MQuaternion``, EulerRotation from ``MEulerRotation``, and Matrix from ``MMatrix``, all of which can be passed directly to om2 functions with operations following om2 semantics (not hashable). Only ``easing`` uses only standard ``math``."

msgid "``cmds``"
msgstr "``cmds``"

msgid "``maya.cmds`` 相当の手続き的 API（createNode、ls、constraint）"
msgstr "Procedural API equivalent to ``maya.cmds`` (createNode, ls, constraint)"

msgid "``decorators``"
msgstr "``decorators``"

msgid "Undo チャンク、選択状態の保存・復元、skinCluster変形を保ったままの joint姿勢編集、画面表示の一時停止"
msgstr "Undo chunk, saving and restoring selection state, joint pose editing with preserved skinCluster deformation, and temporary display pause"

msgid "``json``"
msgstr "``json``"

msgid "JSONの読み書き、型付き状態の保存・復元"
msgstr "Reading and writing JSON, saving and restoring typed states"

msgid "``utils``"
msgstr "``utils``"

msgid "汎用関数、FBX・参照操作、ログ・進捗表示・Version"
msgstr "Generic functions, FBX and reference operations, log and progress display, Version"

msgid "``_core``"
msgstr "``_core``"

msgid "型登録、ラッパー検出、初期化、再読み込みの内部基盤"
msgstr "Type registration, wrapper detection, initialization, and reload internal infrastructure"

msgid "新規ファイルは用途に対応する既存分類へ追加します。 汎用関数は ``utils``、デコレータは ``decorators`` に置きます。 リグ固有の構築は ``hrig.setups`` に置き、Maya標準の関係型は ``scene`` に置きます。 入力の種類判別は ``object.py``、各型への解決は ``Node``・``Plug``・``Component`` が担当します。 ``_core``、``__tests__``、``docs`` はそれぞれ内部基盤、検証、文書用です。 旧配置の互換ファイルは置かず、使用側のimportを正式な配置へ更新します。"
msgstr "New files are added to existing categories that match their purpose. General functions go to ``utils``, and decorators go to ``decorators``. Rig-specific constructions go to ``hrig.setups``, and Maya-standard relational types go to ``scene``. Input type discrimination is handled by ``object.py``, and resolution for each type is managed by ``Node``, ``Plug``, and ``Component``. ``_core``, ``__tests__``, and ``docs`` are for internal foundation, validation, and documentation respectively. Compatibility files from the old layout are not placed, and users should update their import statements to point to the new locations."

msgid "hlib 全体クラス図"
msgstr "hlib Overall Class Diagram"

msgid "hlib全 195 クラスの継承関係を分類ごとの図で表示します。矢印の三角側が基底クラスです。 他の分類の基底クラスは、継承を追えるよう各図にも掲載します。 クラス名をクリックするとAPIリファレンスへ移動できます。"
msgstr "hlib's 195 classes are displayed in diagrams categorized by type. The arrowhead side indicates the base class. Base classes from other categories are also included in each diagram to trace inheritance. Clicking a class name navigates to the API reference."

